  "text": "AFK Kerapac (NM)\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\nStand in melee distance, in the west:\n\n​\nRanged Method (28+ kph) \n​\nRequirements\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\n⬥ Weapon poison+++ \n⬥ Kwuarm sticks \n⬥ Greater Ricochet \n⬥ Greater Death's Swiftness \n⬥ Desolation  or Anguish \n⬥ Soul Split \n⬥ Bonfire Boost \n⬥ Ogre flask (thermal) \n\nOptional:\n⬥ Darkness \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPreset Suggestions \n⬥ Ranged preset\n\n​\nAction Bar \n\n​\nMelee Method (29+ kph) \n​\nRequirements\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\n⬥ Masterwork 2h Sword \n⬥ Weapon poison+++ \n⬥ Kwuarm sticks \n⬥ Malevolence  or Turmoil \n⬥ Soul Split \n⬥ Bonfire Boost \n⬥ Ogre flask (thermal) \n\nOptional:\n⬥ Greater Fury \n⬥ Chaos roar \n⬥ Darkness \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPreset Suggestions \n⬥ Melee preset\n\n​\nAction Bar \n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥  Ranged example kills\n⬥  Melee example kills\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Kerapac (NM) ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning Stand in melee distance, in the west: ​ Ranged Method (28+ kph) ​ Requirements ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel ⬥ Weapon poison+++ ⬥ Kwuarm sticks ⬥ Greater Ricochet ⬥ Greater Death's Swiftness ⬥ Desolation or Anguish ⬥ Soul Split ⬥ Bonfire Boost ⬥ Ogre flask (thermal) Optional: ⬥ Darkness ​ Preset Suggestions ⬥ Ranged preset ​ Action Bar ​ Melee Method (29+ kph) ​ Requirements ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel ⬥ Masterwork 2h Sword ⬥ Weapon poison+++ ⬥ Kwuarm sticks ⬥ Malevolence or Turmoil ⬥ Soul Split ⬥ Bonfire Boost ⬥ Ogre flask (thermal) Optional: ⬥ Greater Fury ⬥ Chaos roar ⬥ Darkness ​ Preset Suggestions ⬥ Melee preset ​ Action Bar ​ Example Kills ⬥ Ranged example kills ⬥ Melee example kills ​",
